==English==

===Verb===
{{head|en|verb|head=[[give]] (somebody ''or'' someone) the [[time]] of [[day]]}}

# {{context|obsolete}} To give (someone) the salutation appropriate to the time of day.
# {{context|idiomatic}} To [[acknowledge]] somebody; to give somebody any respect or attention.
#: ''If he doesn't think you are rich enough, he won't even '''give you the time of day'''.''

====Usage notes====
* '''Give somebody the time of day''' is usually used in the [[negative]].

